{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101195","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101195/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101195/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101195/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101195","id":2771620164,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6lM5FE","number":101195,"title":"Camera2D stops scrolling if physics interpolation is enabled at runtime","user":{"login":"KeyboardDanni","id":34800072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODAwMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34800072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyboardDanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-01-06T23:35:29Z","updated_at":"2025-05-12T01:12:04Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in dev 216b3302\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev (7d645fbea) - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf physics interpolation is initially disabled, and then enabled at runtime, Camera2D stops updating any scrolling, and will only do so if you force it via `force_update_scroll()`. Even though the camera's position updates, the scrolling does not.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2203e82f-ddd5-41fe-823c-228543ef34b6\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Have `physics/common/physics_interpolation` disabled in Project Settings\n- Call `get_tree().set_physics_interpolation_enabled(true);` at some point during runtime\n\nWorkaround is to call `force_update_scroll()` on the Camera2D every frame in `_process()`.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[PhysicsLerpCameraIssue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18325692/PhysicsLerpCameraIssue.zip)\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101195/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101195/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}